    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean, i hear what you're saying about \"mitigating\" and \"shaping\" it, but isn't that just a way to make the transition sound more palatable? if the core technology and the drive for profit are already fundamentally set in motion, isn't any policy talk just a way to manage the fallout of a change that's already inevitable? it feels like we're just talking about how to decorate the room while the house is being rebuilt.",
